      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Case-insensitive Unicode string comparison.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. For each character pair, convert to uppercase if < 0x100\\n2. Compare uppercased values\\n3. Continue until mismatch or null found\\n4. Return -1/0/1 based on comparison result\\n\\nParameters:\\n  in_ECX (ushort*): First Unicode string\\n  in_EDX (ushort*): Second Unicode string\\n\\nReturns:\\n  int: -1 (less), 0 (equal), or 1 (greater)\\n\\nNotes:\\n  - Static __fastcall method\\n  - Uses _toUpperTable for case conversion\\n  - Only Latin-1 characters (< 0x100) case-folded\\n  - Mangled name: ?stricmp@Unicode@@SIHPBU1@0@Z",
