      "name": "strchr",
      "signature": "char * strchr(char * _Str)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "char *",
      "comment": "Find first occurrence of character in Unicode string.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Iterate through string until null terminator\\n2. If character matches search value, return pointer\\n3. If null reached without match, return NULL\\n\\nParameters:\\n  in_ECX (ushort*): Unicode string to search\\n  wChar (ushort): Character to find (stack param, passed as _Str)\\n\\nReturns:\\n  ushort*: Pointer to first occurrence, or NULL if not found\\n\\nNotes:\\n  - Static __fastcall with stack parameter\\n  - Returns NULL if character not in string\\n  - Mangled name: ?strchr@Unicode@@SIPAU1@PBU1@U1@@Z",
