      "name": "strstr",
      "signature": "char * strstr(char * _Str, char * _SubStr)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "char *",
      "comment": "Case-sensitive substring search in Unicode string.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. For each position in haystack string\\n2. Compare current char with needle[0]\\n3. If match, compare remaining chars\\n4. If full match, return pointer to match start\\n5. If no match, continue to next position\\n\\nParameters:\\n  in_ECX (ushort*): Haystack string to search in\\n  in_EDX (ushort*): Needle substring to find\\n\\nReturns:\\n  ushort*: Pointer to first occurrence, or NULL if not found\\n\\nNotes:\\n  - Static __fastcall method\\n  - Case-sensitive comparison\\n  - Returns NULL if either input is NULL\\n  - Mangled name: ?strstr@Unicode@@SIPAU1@PBU1@0@Z",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
