      "name": "win2Unicode",
      "signature": "Unicode * win2Unicode(Unicode * param_1, char * param_2, int param_3)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "Unicode *",
      "comment": "Convert Windows ANSI string to Unicode.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Iterate through source string up to nMaxLen chars\\n2. Convert each byte to 16-bit Unicode (simple widening)\\n3. Add null terminator\\n\\nParameters:\\n  param_1 (Unicode*): ECX - destination Unicode buffer\\n  param_2 (char*): EDX - source ANSI string\\n  param_3 (int): Stack - maximum characters to convert\\n\\nReturns:\\n  Unicode*: Pointer to destination buffer\\n\\nNotes:\\n  - Static __fastcall with stack parameter\\n  - Simple byte-to-ushort conversion (Latin-1 compatible)\\n  - Truncates if source exceeds nMaxLen\\n  - Mangled name: ?win2Unicode@Unicode@@SIPAU1@PAU1@PBDH@Z",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
