      "name": "strncoll",
      "signature": "int strncoll(Unicode * param_1, Unicode * param_2, int param_3)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Locale-aware bounded string collation comparison.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Compare characters using collation table (DAT_6fc4d0fc)\\n2. For chars < 0x100, use locale collation order\\n3. For chars >= 0x100, compare code points directly\\n4. Stop at null or nMaxLen characters\\n\\nParameters:\\n  param_1 (Unicode*): ECX - first string\\n  param_2 (Unicode*): EDX - second string\\n  param_3 (int): Stack - maximum characters to compare\\n\\nReturns:\\n  int: Negative if str1 < str2, 0 if equal, positive if str1 > str2\\n\\nNotes:\\n  - Static __fastcall with stack parameter\\n  - Uses collation weight table for Latin-1 chars\\n  - Falls back to strnicmp for final comparison\\n  - Mangled name: ?strncoll@Unicode@@SIHPBU1@0H@Z",
