      "name": "utfnwidth",
      "signature": "uint utfnwidth(Unicode * param_1, int param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Calculates UTF-8 byte width for bounded Unicode string.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. For each Unicode character up to nMaxChars:\\n   a. Look up encoding length in g_pUtf8EncodingTable\\n   b. Accumulate byte count\\n2. Return total bytes needed\\n\\nParameters:\\n  param_1 (Unicode*): ECX - Unicode string to measure\\n  param_2 (int): Stack - maximum characters to scan\\n\\nReturns:\\n  uint: Number of UTF-8 bytes needed\\n\\nNotes:\\n  - Static __fastcall with stack parameter\\n  - Does not include null terminator in count\\n  - ASCII chars = 1 byte, others = 2-3 bytes\\n  - Mangled name: ?utfnwidth@Unicode@@SIIPBU1@H@Z",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
