      "name": "EncodeCodepointToUtf8",
      "signature": "int EncodeCodepointToUtf8(void * this, uint param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Encodes a Unicode codepoint to UTF-8 bytes.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Mask codepoint to 16 bits\\n2. Find encoding table entry for codepoint range\\n3. Write lead byte: (codepoint >> shift) | prefix\\n4. Write continuation bytes: ((codepoint >> n) & 0x3F) | 0x80\\n\\nParameters:\\n  this (byte*): ECX - output buffer for UTF-8 bytes\\n  dwCodepoint (uint): Unicode codepoint to encode\\n\\nReturns:\\n  int: Number of bytes written (1-4), or -1 on failure\\n\\nUTF-8 Encoding Table (g_pUtf8EncodingTable):\\n  Each 16-byte entry: mask, prefix, shift, reserved, max_value, min_value\\n\\nMagic Numbers:\\n  - 0x3F: 6-bit mask for continuation data\\n  - 0x80: Continuation byte prefix (10xxxxxx)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:5bd71a5744fc362b99403c0e0f8dabbd4d1afd17d89d801aa49d70ef494339aa",
