      "name": "ClearScreenConfigErrors",
      "signature": "void ClearScreenConfigErrors(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Report and clear accumulated screen configuration validation errors.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check g_dwScreenConfig2 for non-zero error state\n2. If non-zero, call ReportValidationError(error) to log/handle\n3. Clear g_dwScreenConfig2 to 0\n4. Check g_dwScreenConfig1 for non-zero error state\n5. If non-zero, call ReportValidationError(error) to log/handle\n6. Clear g_dwScreenConfig1 to 0\n7. Return\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x0 - Error clear marker\n\nGlobal Data:\n- g_dwScreenConfig2 @ 0x6fbf8d30 - Screen config error flag (checked first)\n- g_dwScreenConfig1 @ 0x6fbf8d34 - Screen config error flag (checked second)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
