      "name": "FindCDriveAndOpenArchive",
      "signature": "dword FindCDriveAndOpenArchive(LPSTR szPath, LPCSTR szArchiveSubPath, dword dwPriority, void * * phArchive)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Finds a CD-ROM drive and opens a Storm archive on it.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get list of all logical drive letters using GetLogicalDriveStringsA\n2. Skip leading backslashes in archive subpath\n3. For each drive, check if it's a CD-ROM (type 5)\n4. If CD-ROM found, concatenate path with subpath\n5. Open the Storm archive with SFileOpenArchive\n6. Return 1 on success, 0 if no CD-ROM found\n\nParameters:\n- szPath (LPSTR): Buffer to store full archive path\n- szArchiveSubPath (LPCSTR): Relative archive path on CD-ROM\n- dwPriority (dword): Storm archive priority flag\n- phArchive (void**): Output pointer to opened archive handle\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success (archive opened), 0 on failure (no CD-ROM or open failed)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:4e978c03f82a8d56bd2596a805cc4c998afff0edbc0a26e87ad8af7039bcea5b",
