      "name": "LoadAndValidateStringTable",
      "signature": "D2LangTblHeader * LoadAndValidateStringTable(char * szFilePath)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Loads and validates a D2 language string table (.tbl) file from the game archive.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load the file via LoadArchiveFile from g_pUnicodeSysMap archive handle\n2. Validate dwIndexStart < dwDataEnd to ensure valid data range\n3. Compute CRC-16 checksum over data range [dwIndexStart, dwDataEnd)\n4. Verify computed CRC matches the wVersion field in the header\n5. For each string node (nHashCount entries), validate:\n   - dwKeyOffset < dwDataEnd (key string within bounds)\n   - dwStringOffset < dwDataEnd (value string within bounds)\n\nParameters:\n  szFilePath (char*, ECX): Path to the .tbl file within the archive\n\nReturns:\n  D2LangTblHeader*: Pointer to loaded and validated table header\n  - On success: Valid pointer to the table in memory\n  - On validation failure: Calls FogAssert/ReportError (terminates)\n\nD2LangTblHeader Structure Layout:\n  Offset  Size  Field          Description\n  0x00    2     wVersion       CRC-16 checksum of data section\n  0x02    2     wMaxStrings    Maximum string ID capacity\n  0x04    4     nHashCount     Number of hash/string node entries\n  0x08    1     abReserved[0]  (unused)\n  0x09    4     dwIndexStart   Start offset of indexed data (at abReserved+1)\n  0x11    4     dwDataEnd      End offset of data section\n\nString Node Entry (17 bytes each):\n  Offset  Size  Field           Description\n  0x00    4     dwKeyOffset     Offset to key string from header\n  0x04    4     dwStringOffset  Offset to value string from header\n  +0x08-0x10    (other fields)  Hash chain pointers\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xFFFF - Initial CRC-16 seed value\n  0x11 (17) - Size of each string node entry in bytes\n  0x15 (21) - Base offset to first node from header start\n\nError Handling:\n  - dwIndexStart >= dwDataEnd: Assertion failure, calls ReportError(-1)\n  - CRC mismatch: Assertion failure, calls ReportError(-1)\n  - Node offset out of bounds: Assertion failure, calls ReportError(-1)",
