      "comment": "Checks if position is suitable for line breaking.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Position 0 always allows line break\\n2. For Korean (locale 6): check for specific punctuation marks\\n3. For other locales: check whitespace transition\\n\\nParameters:\\n  param_1 (Unicode*): ECX - pointer to Unicode string\\n  param_2 (uint): EDX - character index to check\\n\\nReturns:\\n  int: 1 if line break allowed, 0 otherwise\\n\\nSpecial Characters (Korean):\\n  - 0x2026: Horizontal ellipsis\\n  - 0x3001, 0x3002: Ideographic comma/period\\n  - 0xFF01, 0xFF0C, 0xFF0E, 0xFF1F: Fullwidth punctuation\\n  - 0xFF61, 0xFF64: Halfwidth punctuation\\n\\nNotes:\\n  - Static __fastcall method\\n  - Language-aware line breaking rules\\n  - Mangled name: ?isLineBreak@Unicode@@SIHPBU1@I@Z",
