      "name": "ValidateStringIdRequest",
      "signature": "void ValidateStringIdRequest(D2LangTblHeader * pHeader, wchar_t * * ppUnicodeArray, ushort wStringId)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Validates string ID and retrieves Unicode pointer from table.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Clamp wStringId to wMaxStrings if out of bounds\\n2. Look up hash index from string ID mapping\\n3. Validate hash index is within nHashCount\\n4. Calculate node pointer in string data\\n5. Assert node is marked as used (bUsed == 1)\\n6. Assert Unicode pointer at that index is not NULL\\n\\nParameters:\\n  pHeader (D2LangTblHeader*): ECX - string table header\\n  ppUnicodeArray (wchar_t**): EDX - array of Unicode string pointers\\n  wStringId (ushort): Stack - string ID to validate\\n\\nReturns:\\n  void (asserts on invalid data)\\n\\nMagic Numbers:\\n  - 0x11 (17): Stride for string node entries\\n  - 500: Default string ID when out of bounds\\n\\nNotes:\\n  - Uses FogAssert for validation failures\\n  - Part of D2Lang string table system",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
