      "name": "DllMainCRTStartup",
      "signature": "BOOL DllMainCRTStartup(HINSTANCE hInstance, DWORD dwReason, LPVOID lpReserved)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "DLL Main CRT Startup Entry Point\n\nC Runtime Library entry point called by Windows when the DLL is loaded/unloaded.\nThis is a Visual Studio 2003 Release library function that initializes the C runtime,\nhandles DLL_PROCESS_ATTACH/DETACH and DLL_THREAD_ATTACH/DETACH notifications.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return FALSE immediately if DLL_PROCESS_DETACH and CRT never initialized\n2. For DLL_PROCESS_ATTACH or DLL_THREAD_ATTACH:\n   a. Call registered DllMain callback if present\n   b. Initialize C Runtime via InitializeCRuntime\n   c. Call application DllMain (ValidateBinkInstallLocation is the user DllMain)\n   d. If attach fails during DLL_PROCESS_ATTACH, cleanup via InitializeCRuntime(0)\n3. For DLL_PROCESS_DETACH or DLL_THREAD_DETACH:\n   a. Cleanup C Runtime first\n   b. Call registered DllMain callback if result still successful\n\nParameters:\n  hInstance  - HINSTANCE - Handle to the DLL module\n  dwReason   - DWORD     - Reason code for calling entry point:\n                           0 = DLL_PROCESS_DETACH\n                           1 = DLL_PROCESS_ATTACH  \n                           2 = DLL_THREAD_ATTACH\n                           3 = DLL_THREAD_DETACH\n  lpReserved - LPVOID    - Reserved; non-NULL for static load, NULL for dynamic load\n\nReturns:\n  BOOL - TRUE (1) if initialization/cleanup succeeded\n         FALSE (0) if initialization/cleanup failed\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If dwReason == 0 and g_nCrtInitCount == 0, returns FALSE (CRT never initialized)\n  - Uses SEH prolog/epilog for structured exception handling\n  - Calls g_pfnDllMain callback pointer if registered by linked code\n\nDecompiler Artifacts:\n  - extraout_var: Represents undefined high bytes when widening bool->int\n    (CONCAT31 synthesizes full EAX from AL return value; upper 24 bits undefined)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0 - DLL_PROCESS_DETACH\n  1 - DLL_PROCESS_ATTACH\n  2 - DLL_THREAD_ATTACH\n  3 - DLL_THREAD_DETACH\n\nGlobals:\n  g_nCrtInitCount (0x6fc105c8) - CRT initialization reference count\n  g_pfnDllMain (0x6fc11e24)    - User-registered DllMain callback pointer",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
