      "name": "LookupStringTableEntry",
      "signature": "void LookupStringTableEntry(StringTableHeader * pStringTable, ushort wIndex, int * pValidationArray)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Validates a string table entry index and returns if valid, aborts on error.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if wIndex is within valid entry count (offset 0x02). If out of range, use fallback index 500.\n2. Lookup entry offset from index table at (base + 0x15 + index*2).\n3. Verify entry offset is less than total entries count (offset 0x04).\n4. Calculate entry data pointer: base + 0x15 + entryCount*2 + entryIndex*0x11.\n5. Verify entry pointer is within data bounds (less than base + dataSize at offset 0x11).\n6. Check entry type byte equals 0x01 (valid entry marker).\n7. Verify validation array slot is non-zero (already loaded).\n8. If all checks pass, return. Otherwise abort with error line number.\n\nParameters:\n- pStringTable (StringTableHeader*, IMPLICIT via EAX): Pointer to string table structure\n- wIndex (ushort, DX): String index to lookup (0-based)\n- pValidationArray (int*, Stack): Pointer to validation tracking array\n\nReturns:\n- void on success (simply returns)\n- Does not return on error (calls CleanupAndAbort)\n\nError Lines:\n- 0x104 (260): Entry index exceeds total entries limit\n- 0x108 (264): Entry data pointer exceeds bounds\n- 0x109 (265): Entry type marker is not 0x01\n- 0x10b (267): Validation array slot is zero (entry not loaded)\n\nStringTableHeader Structure Layout:\nOffset  Size   Field            Description\n0x02    2      wEntryCount      Number of entries in index table\n0x04    4      nTotalEntries    Maximum entry limit for validation\n0x11    4      nDataSize        Size of entry data section\n0x15    var    awIndexTable     Array of ushort entry offsets (count*2 bytes)\nvar     var    EntryData        Entry records (0x11 bytes each)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:ffef019eec82518bc2c226398f4e7f33e8c1a5e20ec5f69b98390003f671ad6e",
