      "name": "InitNumberFormatSuffixes",
      "signature": "void InitNumberFormatSuffixes(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes localized number format suffix characters for large number display.\n\nReads string table entries to obtain locale-specific suffix characters for formatting\nlarge numbers (thousands, millions, billions, trillions). Falls back to default English\nsuffixes (K, M, B, T) if string table entries are empty or contain multi-character strings.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate g_pStringTableData is initialized, abort if null\n2. For each suffix magnitude (K/M/B/T):\n   a. Call FUN_6fc08f80 to lookup string at index (0x14D0 + magnitude)\n   b. Convert wide string to narrow string (max 4 chars + null)\n   c. If result is single character, use that character\n   d. Otherwise, use default ASCII suffix (K=0x4B, M=0x4D, B=0x42, T=0x54)\n   e. Store in corresponding global suffix variable\n3. Re-validate g_pStringTableData after each suffix to catch unload\n\nParameters:\n  None - Uses global string table pointers\n\nReturns:\n  void - Sets global suffix variables on success; aborts on validation failure\n\nError Handling:\n  Calls CleanupAndAbort with line 0x248 (584) if g_pStringTableData is null\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x14D0 - String table index for thousand suffix\n  0x14D1 - String table index for million suffix\n  0x14D2 - String table index for billion suffix\n  0x14D3 - String table index for trillion suffix\n  0x4B (75) - ASCII code for K (Thousand)\n  0x4D (77) - ASCII code for M (Million)\n  0x42 (66) - ASCII code for B (Billion)\n  0x54 (84) - ASCII code for T (Trillion)\n\nGlobals Modified:\n  g_wThousandSuffix (6fc10558) - Wide char suffix for thousands\n  g_wMillionSuffix (6fc1055c) - Wide char suffix for millions\n  g_wBillionSuffix (6fc10560) - Wide char suffix for billions\n  g_wTrillionSuffix (6fc10564) - Wide char suffix for trillions",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.11",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:2b6987b3081514ad8ab8c9f47b3bc8c9189ccdfe638b4486e62af0f3f209b230",
