      "name": "CalculateCrc16Checksum",
      "signature": "void CalculateCrc16Checksum(ushort * pCrcValue, int pDataBase, uint dataStartOffset, uint dataEndOffset)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Computes a 16-bit CRC checksum over a data range using polynomial-based lookup table method.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate dataEndOffset > dataStartOffset; abort if invalid bounds\n2. Initialize CRC accumulator to 0xffff (standard CRC-16 initialization)\n3. For each byte from dataStartOffset to dataEndOffset-1:\n   - Calculate table lookup index: (CRC_high ^ byte_value) & 0xFF\n   - Load 16-bit value from CRC lookup table at DAT_0098fbb0 + (index * 2)\n   - Compute new CRC: (CRC << 8) ^ table_value\n4. Return updated CRC value in pCrcValue\n5. On parameter validation failure, retrieve error code 0x3ec, call CleanupAndAbort with DAT_0098d274, then exit(-1)\n\nParameters:\npCrcValue (ushort*) - Pointer to 16-bit accumulator; receives final CRC-16 value\npDataBase (int) - Base address of data buffer to checksum\ndataStartOffset (uint) - Starting offset within data buffer (inclusive)\ndataEndOffset (uint) - Ending offset within data buffer (exclusive)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - CRC-16 result stored in *pCrcValue on success; function does not return on validation failure\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic Values:\n  0xffff - Initial CRC accumulator value (standard CRC-16 preset)\n  0x3ec - Error code for invalid parameter bounds (dataEndOffset <= dataStartOffset)\n  0x98fbb0 - Address of CRC lookup table with 256 entries (512 bytes, 2 bytes per entry)\n  \nValidation Checks:\n  Requires dataEndOffset > dataStartOffset; calls GetReturnAddress(0x3ec) on failure\n  No bounds checking on pDataBase or pCrcValue; caller must ensure valid pointers\n  \nCalling Convention:\n  __stdcall: Callee cleans stack (RET 0x10 removes 4 parameters)\n  \nLookup Table:\n  CRC polynomial table at DAT_0098fbb0 contains 256 precomputed values (512 bytes)\n  Each entry is 2 bytes (ushort) indexed by byte value XOR with CRC high byte\n  Standard CRC-16-CCITT polynomial or variant used for precomputation",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:c01fa6e1a170b59bdfbcc5c6da6138f7",
